# Committed defaults for local dev.
#
# VITE_API_URL:            axios base path in the browser.
#                          "/api/v1" works everywhere — Vite proxies /api in
#                          dev, Vercel routes /api to the serverless function
#                          in prod.
# VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET:   left blank on purpose. When empty, vite.config.js
#                          auto-detects the backend PORT from server/.env, so
#                          changing PORT there is enough. Set it explicitly
#                          only if the backend isn't in this repo.
VITE_API_URL=/api/v1
